;; The module _operator (Modules/_operator.c): index as PyNumber_Index (PY6g's REQUEST for PY6-core), which operator.py's
;; pure index (a.__index__()) is not ("'float' object cannot be interpreted as an integer", random.randrange's check);
;; since queue 232 the operator functions too (the operators, their in-place forms, the comparisons, truth, is_,
;; getitem's family, concat): built-in functions, so that one stored in a class (glob's _StringGlobber.concat_path =
;; operator.add, pathlib's recursive glob) is called without the instance, as CPython's, where operator.py's pure
;; function bound it; operator.py's pure countOf, indexOf, length_hint, call, attrgetter, itemgetter and methodcaller
;; stand for the rest.



